WEBVTT

NOTE Transcribed from the supplied audio and cross-checked with two speech models. Closing captions stay above the disclosure.

00:00.000 --> 00:01.300 line:90% size:90%
I'm Bill Paparian,

00:01.300 --> 00:02.650 line:90% size:90%
former mayor of Pasadena.

00:02.980 --> 00:05.400 line:90% size:90%
In 2018, City Hall asked us

00:05.400 --> 00:07.400 line:90% size:90%
to approve a sales tax increase

00:07.400 --> 00:09.100 line:90% size:90%
to fund fire stations.

00:09.650 --> 00:10.500 line:90% size:90%
We approved it.

00:10.800 --> 00:14.600 line:90% size:90%
Since then, more than $220 million

00:14.600 --> 00:15.850 line:90% size:90%
has been raised.

00:16.350 --> 00:19.150 line:90% size:90%
Fire stations 33 and 37

00:19.150 --> 00:21.200 line:90% size:90%
remain unfunded.

00:21.500 --> 00:23.300 line:90% size:90%
Now they want us to pay again.

00:23.800 --> 00:25.000 line:90% size:90%
I'm voting no.
